    "A crash record was saved on this computer. It stays here and is never sent anywhere on its own; you can add it when you report the problem.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "A crash record was saved on this computer. It stays here and is never sent anywhere on its own; you can add it when you report the problem."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bu bilgisayara bir çökme kaydı yazıldı. Kayıt yalnız burada durur, kendiliğinden hiçbir yere gönderilmez; sorunu bildirirken ekleyebilirsiniz."}}}},
    "macOS saved a crash report on this Mac. CouchSubs does not send it anywhere; you can add it when you report the problem.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "macOS saved a crash report on this Mac. CouchSubs does not send it anywhere; you can add it when you report the problem."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "macOS bu Mac'e bir çökme raporu yazdı. CouchSubs bunu hiçbir yere göndermez; sorunu bildirirken ekleyebilirsiniz."}}}},
