    "Xbox support is in beta. CouchSubs reads the subtitles in the game picture and shows the translation on your TV or computer. You keep playing with your own controller.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Xbox support is in beta. CouchSubs reads the subtitles in the game picture and shows the translation on your TV or computer. You keep playing with your own controller."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Xbox desteği beta aşamasındadır. CouchSubs oyun görüntüsündeki altyazıları okur ve çeviriyi TV'de ya da bilgisayarda gösterir. Oynamaya kendi kumandanızla devam edersiniz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will need: your home Xbox on the same network, a Microsoft account, and a TV or computer to show the subtitles. Remote play must be turned on on the Xbox.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You will need: your home Xbox on the same network, a Microsoft account, and a TV or computer to show the subtitles. Remote play must be turned on on the Xbox."
          }
