    },
    "The disk is almost full (%.1f GB free). macOS needs free space to read text; free up a few GB and start the translation again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The disk is almost full (%.1f GB free). macOS needs free space to read text; free up a few GB and start the translation again."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disk neredeyse dolu (%.1f GB boş). macOS'in yazıyı okuyabilmesi için boş yer gerekiyor; birkaç GB yer açıp çeviriyi yeniden başlatın."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text reading got stuck. It usually recovers within a minute or two: macOS prepares its text model after the first launch or an update. Don't quit while waiting. If it doesn't recover, restart CouchSubs.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Text reading got stuck. It usually recovers within a minute or two: macOS prepares its text model after the first launch or an update. Don't quit while waiting. If it doesn't recover, restart CouchSubs."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yazı okuma takıldı. Çoğunlukla bir iki dakikada kendiliğinden düzelir: macOS, ilk açılışta ya da güncellemeden sonra okuma modelini hazırlar. Beklerken uygulamayı kapatmayın. Düzelmezse CouchSubs'ı yeniden başlatın."}}}},
    "macOS text reading isn't responding. Subtitles continue with the backup reader.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS text reading isn't responding. Subtitles continue with the backup reader."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS'in yazı okuması yanıt vermiyor. Altyazılar yedek okuyucuyla sürüyor."}}}},
    "This usually clears up within a minute or two: macOS prepares its text model after the first launch or an update. Reading may be a little less accurate until then. If it doesn't clear up, restart CouchSubs.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This usually clears up within a minute or two: macOS prepares its text model after the first launch or an update. Reading may be a little less accurate until then. If it doesn't clear up, restart CouchSubs."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Çoğunlukla bir iki dakikada kendiliğinden geçer: macOS, ilk açılışta ya da güncellemeden sonra okuma modelini hazırlar. O zamana kadar okuma biraz daha az isabetli olabilir. Geçmezse CouchSubs'ı yeniden başlatın."}}}},
    "Restart CouchSubs": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restart CouchSubs"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CouchSubs'ı yeniden başlat"}}}},
    "Text reading got stuck. It usually recovers within a minute or two: the system prepares its text model after the first launch or an update. Keep CouchSubs open. If it doesn't recover, close CouchSubs and open it again.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Text reading got stuck. It usually recovers within a minute or two: the system prepares its text model after the first launch or an update. Keep CouchSubs open. If it doesn't recover, close CouchSubs and open it again."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yazı okuma takıldı. Çoğunlukla bir iki dakikada kendiliğinden düzelir: sistem, ilk açılışta ya da güncellemeden sonra okuma modelini hazırlar. CouchSubs'ı açık tutun. Düzelmezse CouchSubs'ı kapatıp yeniden açın."}}}},
    "Restart the Mac and start the translation again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restart the Mac and start the translation again."
