    "Make sure the PS5 is on (not in rest mode) and on the same Wi-Fi, and that CouchSubs is allowed in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network. You can also type the PS5's IP address (PS5: Settings › Network › Connection Status).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Make sure the PS5 is on (not in rest mode) and on the same Wi-Fi, and that CouchSubs is allowed in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network. You can also type the PS5's IP address (PS5: Settings › Network › Connection Status)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "PS5'in açık (dinlenme modunda değil) ve aynı Wi-Fi'da olduğundan, CouchSubs'a Ayarlar › Gizlilik ve Güvenlik › Yerel Ağ'dan izin verildiğinden emin ol. PS5'in IP adresini de yazabilirsin (PS5: Ayarlar › Ağ › Bağlantı Durumu)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
