    "Only needed if the second account has a login passcode on the PS5. CouchSubs enters it when the PS5 asks. It is stored encrypted on this PC.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only needed if the second account has a login passcode on the PS5. CouchSubs enters it when the PS5 asks. It is stored encrypted on this PC."
          }
