            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paketini açıp kapatmak için oyuna dokun."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installs and updates the CouchSubs TV app on your Samsung, LG or Android TV from this phone, without a computer. Looking for the TV on your network; you can change the brand later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installs and updates the CouchSubs TV app on your Samsung, LG or Android TV from this phone, without a computer. Looking for the TV on your network; you can change the brand later."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs TV uygulamasını Samsung, LG ya da Android TV'nize bilgisayar olmadan, bu telefondan kurar ve günceller. Ağdaki TV aranıyor; markayı sonra değiştirebilirsiniz."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Install the TV app": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Install the TV app"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV uygulamasını kur"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installs the CouchSubs TV app on your Samsung TV from this phone, without a computer. The phone and the TV must be on the same Wi-Fi.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Installs the CouchSubs TV app on your Samsung TV from this phone, without a computer. The phone and the TV must be on the same Wi-Fi."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CouchSubs TV uygulamasını Samsung TV'nize bilgisayar olmadan, bu telefondan kurar. Telefon ve TV aynı Wi-Fi'da olmalı."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Samsung TVs on the network": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Samsung TVs on the network"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ağdaki Samsung TV'ler"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Looking for TVs…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looking for TVs…"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV'ler aranıyor…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No Samsung TV found. Is the TV on and on the same Wi-Fi? You can also type its address below (on the TV: Settings › General › Network › Network Status).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Samsung TV found. Is the TV on and on the same Wi-Fi? You can also type its address below (on the TV: Settings › General › Network › Network Status)."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Samsung TV bulunamadı. TV açık ve aynı Wi-Fi'da mı? Adresini aşağıya elle de yazabilirsiniz (TV'de Ayarlar › Genel › Ağ › Ağ Durumu)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "My TV isn't listed": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "My TV isn't listed"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV'm listede yok"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TV's IP address": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV's IP address"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV'nin IP adresi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Developer mode is on": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Developer mode is on"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geliştirici modu açık"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Developer mode is off": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Developer mode is off"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Geliştirici modu kapalı"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TV's settings are right (Developer mode on, Host PC IP %@), but the TV has not fully restarted since then, so it does not accept the phone yet. Hold the power button on the remote until the TV turns off and comes back on with the Samsung logo (about 5 seconds), or unplug the TV for 30 seconds, then try again.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The TV's settings are right (Developer mode on, Host PC IP %@), but the TV has not fully restarted since then, so it does not accept the phone yet. Hold the power button on the remote until the TV turns off and comes back on with the Samsung logo (about 5 seconds), or unplug the TV for 30 seconds, then try again."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"TV'deki ayar doğru (Geliştirici modu açık, Host PC IP %@), ama TV o zamandan beri tam yeniden başlamadığı için telefonu henüz kabul etmiyor. Kumandanın güç tuşunu TV kapanıp Samsung logosuyla yeniden açılana kadar (yaklaşık 5 saniye) basılı tutun ya da TV'nin fişini 30 saniye çekin, sonra tekrar deneyin."}}}},
    "The TV's Host PC IP is %1$@, but this phone's address is %2$@. In the TV's Developer mode window, set Host PC IP to %2$@, then restart the TV fully (hold the power button until the Samsung logo appears, about 5 seconds).": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The TV's Host PC IP is %1$@, but this phone's address is %2$@. In the TV's Developer mode window, set Host PC IP to %2$@, then restart the TV fully (hold the power button until the Samsung logo appears, about 5 seconds)."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"TV'deki Host PC IP %1$@, bu telefonun adresi %2$@. TV'deki geliştirici modu penceresinde Host PC IP'yi %2$@ yapın, sonra TV'yi tam yeniden başlatın (güç tuşunu Samsung logosu görünene kadar, yaklaşık 5 saniye basılı tutun)."}}}},
    "Developer mode is off on the TV. Turn it on with the steps above, type this phone's address (%@) as Host PC IP, then restart the TV fully (hold the power button until the Samsung logo appears, about 5 seconds).": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Developer mode is off on the TV. Turn it on with the steps above, type this phone's address (%@) as Host PC IP, then restart the TV fully (hold the power button until the Samsung logo appears, about 5 seconds)."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"TV'de geliştirici modu kapalı. Yukarıdaki adımlarla açın, Host PC IP olarak bu telefonun adresini (%@) yazın, sonra TV'yi tam yeniden başlatın (güç tuşunu Samsung logosu görünene kadar, yaklaşık 5 saniye basılı tutun)."}}}},
    "The TV (%1$@) and this phone (%2$@) are on different networks, so the TV refuses the phone. Connect both to the same Wi-Fi (not a guest network or a second router), type the phone's new address as Host PC IP on the TV, then restart the TV fully (hold the power button until the Samsung logo appears, about 5 seconds).": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The TV (%1$@) and this phone (%2$@) are on different networks, so the TV refuses the phone. Connect both to the same Wi-Fi (not a guest network or a second router), type the phone's new address as Host PC IP on the TV, then restart the TV fully (hold the power button until the Samsung logo appears, about 5 seconds)."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"TV (%1$@) ile bu telefon (%2$@) farklı ağlarda, bu yüzden TV telefonu kabul etmiyor. İkisini aynı Wi-Fi'ya bağlayın (misafir ağı ya da ikinci modem değil), TV'de Host PC IP'ye telefonun yeni adresini yazın, sonra TV'yi tam yeniden başlatın (güç tuşunu Samsung logosu görünene kadar, yaklaşık 5 saniye basılı tutun)."}}}},
    "Host PC IP belongs to another device: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Host PC IP belongs to another device: %@"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Host PC IP başka bir cihazın: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on developer mode on the TV": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turn on developer mode on the TV"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV'de geliştirici modunu açın"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. Press 1 2 3 4 5 on the remote (or type 12345 on the on-screen keypad). The Developer mode window opens. On some new models this works on Apps › App Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Press 1 2 3 4 5 on the remote (or type 12345 on the on-screen keypad). The Developer mode window opens. On some new models this works on Apps › App Settings."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Kumandada 1 2 3 4 5 tuşlarına basın (ya da ekran klavyesiyle 12345 yazın). Geliştirici modu penceresi açılır. Bazı yeni modellerde bu, Uygulamalar › Uygulama Ayarları ekranında çalışır."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. Turn Developer mode On, type this phone's address as Host PC IP and press OK:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Turn Developer mode On, type this phone's address as Host PC IP and press OK:"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Developer mode'u On yapın, Host PC IP olarak bu telefonun adresini yazın ve OK'e basın:"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "4. Restart the TV: hold the power button on the remote and keep holding until the TV turns off and comes back on with the Samsung logo (about 5 seconds); letting go when it turns off only puts it on standby. If no logo appears, unplug the TV for 30 seconds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. Restart the TV: hold the power button on the remote and keep holding until the TV turns off and comes back on with the Samsung logo (about 5 seconds); letting go when it turns off only puts it on standby. If no logo appears, unplug the TV for 30 seconds."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "4. TV'yi yeniden başlatın: kumandanın güç tuşunu TV kapanıp Samsung logosuyla yeniden açılana kadar (yaklaşık 5 saniye) bırakmadan basılı tutun; TV kapanınca bırakırsanız yalnız bekleme moduna geçer. Logo görünmezse TV'nin fişini 30 saniye çekin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not find this phone's address; is it on Wi-Fi?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Could not find this phone's address; is it on Wi-Fi?"
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Telefonun adresi bulunamadı; Wi-Fi'a bağlı mı?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first install asks you to sign in once with a free Samsung account: Samsung only accepts the app signed with a certificate made for your TV. If the phone's address changes, repeat the Host PC IP step.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first install asks you to sign in once with a free Samsung account: Samsung only accepts the app signed with a certificate made for your TV. If the phone's address changes, repeat the Host PC IP step."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "İlk kurulumda bir kez ücretsiz Samsung hesabıyla giriş istenir: Samsung uygulamayı yalnız sizin TV'nize özel sertifikayla kabul eder. Telefonun adresi değişirse Host PC IP adımı yinelenir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
