    "Do You Know the PS5's Address?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Do You Know the PS5's Address?"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "PS5'in Adresini Biliyor musunuz?"}}}},
    "On the PS5, the IP address is shown in Settings › Network › Connection Status.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "On the PS5, the IP address is shown in Settings › Network › Connection Status."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "PS5'te Ayarlar › Ağ › Bağlantı Durumu'nda IP adresi yazar."}}}},
    "Show Log File": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Show Log File"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Günlük Dosyasını Göster"}}}},
    "If the problem continues, attach the log file to an issue on GitHub.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "If the problem continues, attach the log file to an issue on GitHub."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Sorun sürerse günlük dosyasını GitHub'daki sorun bildirimine ekleyin."}}}},
    "Show Subtitles on the TV": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Show Subtitles on the TV"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Altyazı TV'de Görünsün"}}}},
    "We found a TV on the network. Choose it and CouchSubs installs its app on the TV by itself.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "We found a TV on the network. Choose it and CouchSubs installs its app on the TV by itself."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ağda bir TV bulduk. Seçin, CouchSubs uygulamasını TV'ye kendisi kursun."}}}},
    "We're looking for TVs on the network. Choose yours and CouchSubs installs its app on the TV by itself.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "We're looking for TVs on the network. Choose yours and CouchSubs installs its app on the TV by itself."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ağdaki TV'leri arıyoruz. Seçin, CouchSubs uygulamasını TV'ye kendisi kursun."}}}},
    "TVS ON THE NETWORK": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "TVS ON THE NETWORK"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "AĞDAKİ TV'LER"}}}},
    "Not in the List?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Not in the List?"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Listede Yok mu?"}}}},
    "Choose the Brand and Add It Manually": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Choose the Brand and Add It Manually"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Markayı Seçip Elle Ekleyin"}}}},
    "I Don't Have a TV": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "I Don't Have a TV"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "TV'm Yok"}}}},
    "Checking Developer Mode": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Checking Developer Mode"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Geliştirici Modu Denetleniyor"}}}},
    "Installing the App": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Installing the App"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Uygulama Kuruluyor"}}}},
    "Installation Complete": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Installation Complete"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kurulum Tamam"}}}},
    "Approve the code on the TV, then let's try it.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Approve the code on the TV, then let's try it."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "TV'de kodu onaylayın, sonra deneyelim."}}}},
    "CODE SHOWN ON THE TV": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "CODE SHOWN ON THE TV"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "TV'DE GÖRÜNEN KOD"}}}},
    "Do You See This Code on Your TV Too?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Do You See This Code on Your TV Too?"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bu Kod TV'nizde de Görünüyor mu?"}}}},
    "If you see the same code, you're on the right TV. Approving completes the pairing.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "If you see the same code, you're on the right TV. Approving completes the pairing."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Aynı kodu görüyorsanız doğru TV'desiniz. Onaylayınca eşleşme tamamlanır."}}}},
    "I See This Code on the TV": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "I See This Code on the TV"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "TV'de Bu Kodu Görüyorum"}}}},
    "Paired": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Paired"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Eşleşti"}}}},
    "If the installation continues in the background, it shows on the home screen when it's done.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "If the installation continues in the background, it shows on the home screen when it's done."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kurulum arka planda sürerse bitince ana ekranda görünür."}}}},
    "Approve the code on the TV to continue. If you don't have a TV, skip with \"I Don't Have a TV\".": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Approve the code on the TV to continue. If you don't have a TV, skip with \"I Don't Have a TV\"."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Devam etmek için TV'deki kodu onaylayın. TV'niz yoksa \"TV'm Yok\" seçeneğiyle geçebilirsiniz."}}}},
    "Open CouchSubs on the TV. When it shows a code, it appears here too.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Open CouchSubs on the TV. When it shows a code, it appears here too."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "TV'de CouchSubs'ı açın. Kod gösterince burada da görünür."}}}},
    "Show Subtitles on This Computer": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Show Subtitles on This Computer"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Altyazıyı Bu Bilgisayarda Göster"}}}},
    "TV INPUT": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "TV INPUT"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "TV GİRİŞİ"}}}},
    "Which TV Input Is the PS5 Plugged Into?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Which TV Input Is the PS5 Plugged Into?"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "PS5 TV'nin Hangi Girişine Takılı?"}}}},
    "CouchSubs opens this input on the TV to show subtitles over the game. If the wrong input is chosen, the screen stays black.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "CouchSubs opens this input on the TV to show subtitles over the game. If the wrong input is chosen, the screen stays black."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "CouchSubs, altyazıyı oyunun üstünde göstermek için TV'de bu girişi açar. Yanlış giriş seçilirse ekran siyah kalır."}}}},
    "I Don't Know, Try Them in Turn": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "I Don't Know, Try Them in Turn"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bilmiyorum, Sırayla Dene"}}}},
    "We open the inputs one by one; you confirm when you see the picture.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "We open the inputs one by one; you confirm when you see the picture."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Girişleri tek tek açarız, görüntüyü görünce onaylarsınız."}}}},
    "How Do I Tell?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "How Do I Tell?"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Nereden Anlarım?"}}}},
    "The number is printed on the back of the TV next to the port the PS5 cable is plugged into. If the PS5 is plugged into a sound system (soundbar, amplifier), choose the input the sound system is connected to.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The number is printed on the back of the TV next to the port the PS5 cable is plugged into. If the PS5 is plugged into a sound system (soundbar, amplifier), choose the input the sound system is connected to."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "PS5 kablosunun takılı olduğu yuvanın yanında TV'nin arkasında numarası yazar. PS5 bir ses sistemine (soundbar, amfi) takılıysa ses sisteminin TV'ye bağlı olduğu girişi seçin."}}}},
    "HDMI %lld · Trying": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "HDMI %lld · Trying"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "HDMI %lld · Deneniyor"}}}},
    "No picture on this input.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No picture on this input."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bu girişte görüntü yok."}}}},
    "Do You See the Game Picture on the TV?": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Do You See the Game Picture on the TV?"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "TV'de Oyun Görüntüsünü Görüyor musunuz?"}}}},
    "Yes": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Yes"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Evet"}}}},
    "Confirmed": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Confirmed"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Onaylandı"}}}},
    "No, Next Input": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "No, Next Input"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hayır, Sonraki Giriş"}}}},
    "The choice is remembered. You can change it later in Settings › Consoles.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The choice is remembered. You can change it later in Settings › Consoles."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Seçim hatırlanır. Sonradan Ayarlar › Konsollar'dan değiştirebilirsiniz."}}}},
    "HDMI %lld saved.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "HDMI %lld saved."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "HDMI %lld kaydedildi."}}}},
    "Confirm the picture to continue.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Confirm the picture to continue."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Devam etmek için görüntüyü onaylayın."}}}},
    "SETUP · TRANSLATION": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "SETUP · TRANSLATION"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "KURULUM · ÇEVİRİ"}}}},
    "Better Translation (Free)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Better Translation (Free)"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Daha İyi Çeviri (Ücretsiz)"}}}},
    "If you like, add a free Gemini key. Without it the free translation is used; you can also add it later in Settings.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "If you like, add a free Gemini key. Without it the free translation is used; you can also add it later in Settings."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "İsterseniz ücretsiz bir Gemini anahtarı ekleyin. Eklemezseniz ücretsiz çeviri kullanılır, sonra Ayarlar'dan da ekleyebilirsiniz."}}}},
    "HOW TO GET A KEY": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "HOW TO GET A KEY"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "ANAHTAR NASIL ALINIR"}}}},
    "Press Get a Free Key and sign in with your Google account.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Press Get a Free Key and sign in with your Google account."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ücretsiz Anahtar Al'a basın ve Google hesabınızla giriş yapın."}}}},
    "Press Create API Key and copy the key.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Press Create API Key and copy the key."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "API Anahtarı Oluştur'a basın ve anahtarı kopyalayın."}}}},
    "Paste the key here and press Save and Test.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Paste the key here and press Save and Test."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Anahtarı buraya yapıştırın ve Kaydet ve Dene'ye basın."}}}},
    "Get a Free Key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Get a Free Key"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ücretsiz Anahtar Al"}}}},
    "The free key has a per-minute limit. When the limit is reached, that line is translated with the free translation.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The free key has a per-minute limit. When the limit is reached, that line is translated with the free translation."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ücretsiz anahtarın dakikalık bir sınırı var. Sınıra gelinince o satır ücretsiz çeviriyle çevrilir."}}}},
    "API KEY": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "API KEY"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "API ANAHTARI"}}}},
    "Save and Test": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Save and Test"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Kaydet ve Dene"}}}},
    "Working": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Working"}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Çalışıyor"}}}},
