    "We test each part one by one. You should see a sample Turkish subtitle on the TV.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "We test each part one by one. You should see a sample Turkish subtitle on the TV."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Her parçayı tek tek deniyoruz. TV'de örnek bir Türkçe altyazı görmelisiniz."}}}},
