    "The PS5 picture hasn't arrived for %lld seconds.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The PS5 picture hasn't arrived for %lld seconds."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "PS5 görüntüsü %lld saniyedir gelmiyor."}}}},
    "The connection may have weakened. CouchSubs is trying to reconnect; if it doesn't, check that you're on the same Wi-Fi network as the PS5 and using 5 GHz.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The connection may have weakened. CouchSubs is trying to reconnect; if it doesn't, check that you're on the same Wi-Fi network as the PS5 and using 5 GHz."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bağlantı zayıflamış olabilir. CouchSubs yeniden bağlanmayı deniyor; olmazsa PS5 ile aynı Wi-Fi ağında olduğunuzu ve 5 GHz kullandığınızı kontrol edin."}}}},
