    "Natural voices, downloaded once. Each line takes a moment to prepare, so the voice may come a little after the subtitle.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Natural voices, downloaded once. Each line takes a moment to prepare, so the voice may come a little after the subtitle."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Doğal sesler, bir kez indirilir. Her satır biraz hazırlandığı için ses altyazıdan biraz sonra gelebilir."}}}},
    "This Mac's own Turkish voice: speaks right away, no download needed. Sounds more mechanical.": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "This Mac's own Turkish voice: speaks right away, no download needed. Sounds more mechanical."}}, "tr": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Bu Mac'in kendi Türkçe sesi: hemen konuşur, indirme gerekmez. Daha mekanik duyulur."}}}},
